NOTIFICATION
============

<% if @actor %>
<%= @actor.full_name %> performed an activity that may interest you.
<% end %>

<% presenter = NotificationPresenter.new(@notification) %>
<%= presenter.message %>

<% if @notification.notifiable %>
Related to: <%= @notification.notifiable_display_name %>

<% end %>
View details: <%= @action_url %>

<% if @notification.group_count > 1 %>
This notification includes <%= pluralize(@notification.group_count, 'activity') %>.
<% end %>

--
This notification was sent because you have notifications enabled for this activity.
Manage preferences: <%= @preferences_url %>
Unsubscribe: <%= @unsubscribe_url %>